  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Firestorm",
    "summary": "When the Fire Overwatch Stratagem targets this model immediately after a hostile unit able to FLY begins or finishes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move, then while that Stratagem is resolved, in addition to firing at that unit you may choose a maximum of 3 further enemy units that can FLY and are 24\" or less from this model. This model may shoot each of those with its Firestorm scatter laser too (as long as it qualifies as an eligible target); however, for those shots only an unmodified 6 on the Hit roll scores a hit.",
